  title: Burning garbage is against the law
  body: Burning trash in the open releases toxic smoke and greenhouse gases. The
    Ecological Solid Waste Management Act (RA 9003) bans open burning of waste, and
    the Clean Air Act (RA 8749) bans burning that gives off toxic fumes.
